e acoustic and LED display alarm will alert you if a door is open, helping to conserve energy and maintain optimal temperatures.\n \n\n \nTechnical Specifications\nâ€¢\tModel: H760FSB-WD\nâ€¢\tAppliance Type: Triple Door, French Door Refrigerator (FS â€“ Freestanding)\nâ€¢\tNet Capacity (Total): 575 Litres\nâ€¢\tNet Capacity (Fridge): 435 Litres\nâ€¢\tNet Capacity (Freezer): 140 Litres\nâ€¢\tEnergy Efficiency Class: A+\nâ€¢\tDefrost System: Total No Frost\nâ€¢\tControl Panel: Electronic Touch with LED Display\nâ€¢\tWater Dispenser: Non-Plumbed\nâ€¢\tConnectivity: Smart Wi-Fi\nâ€¢\tNoise Level: 43 dB(A)\nâ€¢\tCoolant: R600a\nâ€¢\tDimensions (HxWxD with external handle): 1785 x 914 x 776 mm\nâ€¢\tColour: Black\nâ€¢\tFreezer Star Rating: 4 Star\n\n",
